Anna: That sounds lovely. You can pay me back whenever you like.
Tom: Thank you. I''ll give it back as soon as I get my pocket money.
Anna: Don''t worry about it. That''s what friends are for.
Tom: You''re really kind. I''ll remember this and help you in return one day.
Anna: I know you will. Now go and enjoy the show!', '汤姆向安娜借20英镑买音乐剧的票,想和姐姐一起去看;安娜爽快答应,说什么时候还都行;汤姆说一拿到零花钱就还,并表示日后定会回报;安娜说朋友就该这样。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How much money does Tom want to borrow?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Twenty pounds.","Ten pounds.","Fifty pounds.","Two pounds."]},{"q":"What does Tom want to buy?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A new coat.","A ticket for a musical.","A book for school.","Some food."]},{"q":"When does Tom plan to pay Anna back?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["As soon as he gets his pocket money.","Never.","Tomorrow morning.","In ten years."]},{"q":"What does Anna say about paying her back?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["He must pay her today.","He can pay her back whenever he likes.","He should pay her double.","He cannot borrow from her."]},{"q":"How does Tom feel about Anna''s help?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He is angry with her.","He thinks she is unfair.","He is grateful and wants to help her in return.","He no longer needs the money."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U5');
Girl: I''d like to open a savings account, please. I want to start saving my pocket money.
Clerk: That''s a wise idea. How much would you like to put in to start?
Girl: Just ten pounds for now. I plan to add a little every month.
Clerk: Perfect. Saving a small sum regularly is the best habit of all.
Girl: My grandfather always says I should save for a rainy day.
Clerk: He gives excellent advice. Here is your new account book.
Girl: Thank you. I feel quite grown-up now!', '女孩到银行想开一个储蓄账户,打算把零花钱存起来;职员说这很明智,问她先存多少;女孩说先存10英镑,以后每月再加一点;职员说定期存小钱是最好的习惯;女孩说爷爷常叮嘱她未雨绸缪;职员夸建议很好并递上账户本。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does the girl want to do at the bank?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Open a savings account.","Take out a large loan.","Buy a musical ticket.","Close her account."]},{"q":"How much will she put in to start?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["One hundred pounds.","Ten pounds.","Fifty pounds.","Nothing at all."]},{"q":"What does the clerk call the best habit of all?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Spending money quickly.","Borrowing from friends.","Saving a small sum regularly.","Keeping cash at home."]},{"q":"What advice does the girl''s grandfather give?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Spend everything at once.","Never use a bank.","Lend money to strangers.","Save for a rainy day."]},{"q":"How does the girl feel at the end?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Quite grown-up.","Very sad.","Bored and tired.","Angry with the clerk."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U5');
